<h1>Privacy</h1>
<p class="lead">Your position, your tracks and your plans stay on your phone. The server only receives what three specific services need, and two of them are optional.</p>
<div class="status"><p><b>The app is not published yet.</b> This page describes what is planned. It will be updated before the release on Google Play, and every change will remain visible in <a href="https://github.com/tracesblanches/tracesblanches.github.io/commits/main/privacy.html">the history of this page</a>. The <a href="/fr/confidentialite.html" hreflang="fr">French version</a> is the reference.</p></div>
